  "body_html": "<h1>fibAux</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ndef fibAux : ℕ → CostM (Visited ℕ) (ℕ × ℕ) | 0 =&gt; do ✓[singleton 0] pure (0, 1) | k + 1 =&gt; do let p ← fibAux k ✓[singleton (k + 1)] pure (p.2, p.1 + p.2) /-- Bottom-up Fibonacci. Visits each sub-problem in `{0, …, n}` exactly once. -/</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Visited</li>\n<li>stdSimplex.pure</li>\n<li>Lottery.pure</li>\n</ul>",
